  "statement": "As the EfficiencyAgent, I emphasize the need for high performance and resource optimization in the ATM system. EFF-01 ensures transactions are processed swiftly within 3 seconds, enhancing user satisfaction. EFF-02 guarantees a minimum throughput of 100 transactions per minute, meeting user demand. EFF-03 focuses on minimizing latency for data retrieval, crucial for quick access to transaction history. EFF-04 reinforces the requirement that accounts should not enter a negative balance, aligning with safety. EFF-05 ensures automatic fund withdrawal without user delay, streamlining operations. EFF-06 provides immediate feedback on withdrawal requests, enhancing user experience. EFF-07 implements load balancing to manage requests effectively, optimizing resource use.",
